[en.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK]
Scorpan’s Threat: §YGet rid of Sendak§!

[en.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK_desc]
Scorpan has made it clear: either we get rid of Sendak, or Tirek will get rid of us.

[en.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK_TIMEOUT_TOOLTIP]
§RLord Tirek will destroy everything...§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK]
斯科潘的威胁：§Y除掉僧达克§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK_desc]
斯科潘已经将意思表达得很明确了：要么我们除掉僧达克，要么提雷克除掉我们。

[zh.DECISION_C18_PRESSURE_FOR_WAR_ON_SENDAK_TIMEOUT_TOOLTIP]
§R提雷克大王将摧毁一切...§!
